Here I am, Gayoi!
I've traveled a lot to other places, but I haven't really been to the usual ho-cations, movie theaters, or amusement parks... Maybe that's why Editmon seems familiar with so many places and takes me to new places. It's quite fun. This is how young people these days have fun!!!! 🌟

⁰ Instagram:
@gayooii 
https://www.instagram.com/gayooii/

Busan is close to my hometown, but I don't get to go there often. I only go there occasionally for work, so taking the train to go and have fun like this feels exciting and new! Honestly, I thought ho-cations were just a lot of fun!!! But it's different from nature. There's a lot to eat and see, and it feels like spending a day in a clean place, so it's nice... But I also love nature! 🌳

Regardless, who you do something with is important! Thanks to you, I was able to see the ocean for the first time in a while, eat delicious grilled fish, and it was a fun day. Aaaah, thank you to Codez Combine Innerwear for creating this new experience. Thanks to you, Mr. Seon. Jjang-chan underwear, Jjang-chan, good. I was happy enough just from going to Busan, but there's a special event for subscribers!!!!! I'm so proud that I usually wear Codez underwear.

